Looking at the demos, the pattern is:
1. Find the cross (uniform row and column of line color)
2. Remove the cross line row and column to get output size
3. Identify the noisy quadrant
4. Fill all quadrants with the noisy pattern (noise → line color), reflected

The output grid is (H-1) × (W-1) since we remove one row and one column.

